From: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>
Subject: [PATCH] iOS: connect shared runtime to the shell build pipeline

Reuse route C preparation and the existing opt-in FS builder from the standard
NSP pipeline. Keep FH as the default and stage the shared runtime beside the game.

Front-ends: --shared-runtime requires --shell-framework and emits both frameworks.
Upstream-Status: pending
Reason: Complete the maintainer-requested opt-in shared runtime launcher path.
Issue: none (maintainer-requested shared runtime experiment)

